The Go interpreter adapts algorithms and behavior from deps/lua/src/ltable.c,
llex.c, lparser.c, lcode.c, lvm.c, ldo.c, ldebug.c, lobject.c, lbaselib.c,
lfunc.c, lstate.h, lua.h, and luaconf.h in Redis 7.2.16.
The register instruction representation and coroutine stack implementation
are specific to this Go implementation.

