The interpreter follows Redis's protected-call behavior and read-only table
extension. Redis is also an external reference service. The original reference
corpus and capture wrapper were supplied by acneism on 2026-10-24.
New reference answers are captured from Redis with the same wrapper.

No string, table, math, bit, struct, cjson, cmsgpack, fpconv, CRC64, or LZF
library implementation is included in A1. Add notices from the exact upstream
source headers when those components are ported.
